def VDIF.8Ch2bit1to1;
* mode =  1    stations =Nl:Fd:Pt:La:Ov:Kp:Br:Gb
*    firmware_type = RDBE_DDC;
*    format = VDIF, and fan-out = 1
*    mode requires 256.00Mb/s/tr; stations using disks
